  "description": "This package for F# developers contains types and modules which allow developers to quickly create sequences of numerical data.\n    This numerical data can be given different 'shapes' and modified in various ways to produce data for testing, or whenever a sequence of numbers is required.\n    All of the sequences generated by the functions in this package are standard F# sequences, and all of the internal processing is done exclusively \n    with standard F# sequences, so they give you all of the benefits of, and follow the same rules as, standard F# sequences.\n    See the README for more information.",
